# .homeostasis — optional per-repository configuration for homeostasis.
#
# Copy to `.homeostasis` at the root of the primary checkout and COMMIT it (an
# untracked .homeostasis is itself reported as an untracked path), or list it
# in .git/info/exclude.
#
# Format: one KEY=value per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are
# ignored. One pair of surrounding quotes is stripped. Nothing is expanded or
# executed: the file is parsed, never sourced. Unknown keys are ignored with a
# warning; an invalid value for a known key stops the run (exit 2).
# Environment variables of the same name always win over this file.

# The branch the primary must sit on. Default: read from <remote>/HEAD,
# falling back to `main`.
#HOMEOSTASIS_MAIN_BRANCH=main

# The remote that holds the main branch. Default: origin.
#HOMEOSTASIS_REMOTE=origin

# Where agent worktrees live, relative to the primary; scanned for debris
# directories git no longer registers. Empty disables the debris check.
# Default: .claude/worktrees (Claude Code's agent worktree location).
#HOMEOSTASIS_WORKTREES_DIR=.claude/worktrees

# Ignored paths that are safe to lose with a worktree because a fresh checkout
# recreates them. Space-separated, relative, no globs. Setting this REPLACES
# the default list. `.env` is not in the default on purpose — add it only if
# your setup regenerates it (e.g. copies it from a template).
#HOMEOSTASIS_REGENERABLE=node_modules vendor .venv dist build coverage .env

# Orphan per-worktree MySQL test schemas (check 7). Off unless a container is
# named. Assumes your setup creates `<prefix>_<worktree basename>` with every
# character outside [A-Za-z0-9] replaced by `_`, and that the container is the
# official mysql image (root password in MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD).
#HOMEOSTASIS_MYSQL_CONTAINER=myproject-mysql-1
#HOMEOSTASIS_SCHEMA_PREFIX=testing

# PR awareness via the GitHub CLI: auto (use gh when installed) or off.
#HOMEOSTASIS_GH=auto

# Only meaningful with gh off/unavailable: 1 treats "no PR information" as
# "no open PRs" so finished worktrees can be removed in a repository that does
# not use pull requests. A loud banner is printed on every run while it is on.
#HOMEOSTASIS_TRUST_NO_PRS=0
